<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.073 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.073 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 1.073 billion zlotys worth of Polish T-bills at the weekly primary tender against a one billion zloty offer, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
